###
## Worker: Get Default Weather
# Returns weather for the main Farm location (from database).
GET {{baseUrl}}/weather/current
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}

### Worker: Get GPS Location Weather
# Returns weather for where the worker is standing (e.g., inside a field).
# Useful for mobile apps sending GPS coordinates.
GET {{baseUrl}}/weather/current?latitude=36.75&longitude=3.05
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}
### Farmer: Get Current Dashboard
# Returns detailed current conditions (UV, Wind, Humidity) for the Farm.
GET {{baseUrl}}/weather/current
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

### Farmer: Get 7-Day Forecast
# Returns a summary for each day of the coming week.
GET {{baseUrl}}/weather/forecast/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

### Farmer: Get Hourly Forecast
# Returns weather data for the next 24 hours (e.g., for planning work shifts).
GET {{baseUrl}}/weather/forecast/hourly
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}

### Farmer: Get Recommendations
# Returns smart advice (e.g., "Irrigate now", "Avoid spraying") based on data.
GET {{baseUrl}}/weather/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{farmerToken}}
